 "ab_note": "Clean A/B, idle CPU, 2 reps (min), builds interleaved: stock Vyb 0.7.7 vs the jit inline/host-CPU PR; 4-byte descriptors measured on stock. CPU only (CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES empty).",
