  "vyb": "host runner on stock Vyb 0.7.7 (c14d4768) on the Sparks, Vyb perf/kernel-friction (bbe08ae5) on the 3090; kernel PTX from Vyb perf/kernel-friction (atomics/ballot/popc/ctz from perf/kernel-atomics-bits, plus shfl_xor_i64)",
  "method": "exact without float atomics: push sets bits of a CSC-position bitmap (red.global.or), update walks each target's bitmap range in ascending source order (ctz) with 8 weight loads in flight per round, summing in the reference order",
